# Kept locally, never committed — decided deliberately, and re-decided after a
# `git add -A` swept them in. The audit reports are point-in-time documents
# that go stale, and AUDIT_REPORT.md quotes a real staff email address, which
# is the exact finding (L-4) that was cleaned out of this public repo once
# already. go_live_reset.sql deletes every order and belongs nowhere near a
# checkout someone might run without reading.
AUDIT_REPORT*.md
supabase/go_live_reset.sql
